{"parentUuid":"aea28da7-965f-4ee9-bc46-83c56b6ca6ae","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5c3145ddf1f0dffe","attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14804330 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c14247e7-50b4-4153-9464-5561cf147818","timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:22:18.733Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14804330 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA/.worktrees/phase4-alignment","sessionId":"b8143861-beec-4930-9c27-06bc9d94fa8b","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"c14247e7-50b4-4153-9464-5561cf147818","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5c3145ddf1f0dffe","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ceu3Kj1h5CPgppJX9QYPS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J5imfbSv7tNELyRx7xzkMc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-playcalls-phase4-alignment-design.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git log --oneline -1\nPhase 4 design: alignment vs outcome, with two data questions resolved\n\nPhase 1 located the decline but could not explain it. Phase 4 tests whether\nalignment does, and the spec's core is an arithmetic split of the 2024->2025\nchange into a mix term (Baylor lined up differently) and an efficacy term\n(the same look produced less).\n\nTwo undocumented PFF fields had to be resolved before they could be used, and\nboth resolutions are recorded with their evidence rather than assumed:\n\n- offense_package is a WR-FB-RB-TE count of the five non-OL, non-QB players.\n  Proven against the chart's Personnel column and against the 11-jersey\n  offense_players list; the (*) and (+Q) suffixes are unidentified players and\n  an extra quarterback. The chart's Personnel column stays primary because it\n  is 100% filled and offense_package is not.\n\n- mofo_coverage_played_shown reads shown-then-played, which contradicts the\n  word order in its own name. Character 2 agrees with Baylor's 2024 charted\n  coverage family on 91.8% of plays against character 1's 67.1%, and defences\n  show open then rotate closed three times as often as the reverse. The\n  evidence is followed rather than the label.\n\nThe spec also records which alignment columns cannot be used at all: Baylor\nstopped charting Front, Cover Family and RB Align in 2025, so no cross-year\nread of them exists. PFF's ball_snapped_from recovers the hash, which the\nchart's Hash_O never carried in either season.\n\nNo human was available for the brainstorming approval gates, so each decision\nis written into the spec as a numbered decision record with its reasoning.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cpiq4uQvzv6fct94zkaVCX\nEOF","description":"Commit the Phase 4 design spec"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_read_input_tokens":123695,"output_tokens":824,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":478},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":824,"cache_read_input_tokens":123695,"cache_creation_input_tokens":478,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":478,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ceu3Ki3tXgaSdasxgdXcW","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","attributionSkill":"superpowers:using-git-worktrees","attributionPlugin":"superpowers","type":"assistant","uuid":"79d1977e-6600-4ee8-a158-e984aaf93db2","timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:22:31.508Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA/.worktrees/phase4-alignment","sessionId":"b8143861-beec-4930-9c27-06bc9d94fa8b","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"main"}
