{"parentUuid":"6da6401e-7ecc-462c-8212-27e93600d2fb","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5c3145ddf1f0dffe","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ceu3duPmnR99KRQgViDGC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016YacxBP5fMEexjVhB9Xz4Q","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-09-playcalls-phase4.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git log --oneline -1\nPhase 4 implementation plan: ten tasks, tests first\n\nDecomposes the spec into ten TDD tasks with the failing test written out for\neach one. The task boundaries follow the merge boundary Phase 2 imposes: the\nonly pre-existing file in the whole plan is charting.py, and only its column\ndict.\n\nThree tests in the plan exist specifically to catch silent failures this\nrepository has already been bitten by:\n\n- a pin that a naive play_id .astype(str) join matches zero rows, so the\n  float64 trap cannot quietly come back\n- an equivalence test between the decomposition's group rates and\n  analysis.rate_by, because a divergence between the descriptive tables and\n  the decomposition would be invisible and would put two different numbers for\n  the same cut into one report\n- a pin on the mofo character-2 agreement rate, so a data refresh cannot\n  silently invert the conclusion the defensive-look tables are built on\n\nThe report task's tests assert the prose changes when the table changes, in\nboth directions - including that the null-result sentence disappears when the\nmix term dominates. Phase 1 shipped two wrong numbers with 68 tests passing\nbecause the tests only checked what had been thought of; asserting the\nnegative case is the cheap part of not repeating that.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cpiq4uQvzv6fct94zkaVCX\nEOF","description":"Commit the implementation plan"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":23882,"cache_read_input_tokens":127748,"output_tokens":626,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":23882},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":626,"cache_read_input_tokens":127748,"cache_creation_input_tokens":23882,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":23882,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ceu3dsuyDHXUvChho58Ym","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","attributionSkill":"superpowers:using-git-worktrees","attributionPlugin":"superpowers","type":"assistant","uuid":"053319dd-dd45-4908-9f04-76cd57fb5aca","timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:26:36.113Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA/.worktrees/phase4-alignment","sessionId":"b8143861-beec-4930-9c27-06bc9d94fa8b","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"main"}
