{"parentUuid":"9261637e-b1e9-47f1-88db-9cc52c93ccea","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5c3145ddf1f0dffe","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ceu3gxV8i8vwBtp9KVpZa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HN7VTLiVPD5v6PKBcvystd","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add -A && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git log --oneline -1\nWiden the charting column selection for alignment work\n\nTen alignment columns added to charting._COLUMNS. Strictly additive: no\nexisting entry, cast or drop rule changes, and the 76 pre-existing tests still\npass unchanged.\n\nFour of the ten are carried despite being unusable cross-year. RB Align is\n89.9% filled in 2024 and 0.0% in 2025; Front Adjust fell 32.0% to 9.5%; Stunt\nkept its fill but 2025 collapsed it to a bare \"Y\" on 110 of 113 rows; Hash_O is\nempty in both. They are loaded so the report can name each one and say why no\ntable was built from it. A reader who expects a front-versus-outcome cut needs\nto be told it cannot exist, not left to assume it was overlooked.\n\nThe strict missing-column check in load_season makes this safe rather than\nrisky: if a future re-export drops one of these, the loader fails loudly\ninstead of yielding a silently empty dimension. load_season already cannot read\n2021-2023 (they have no pff_DOWN) and is only called for 2024 and 2025.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cpiq4uQvzv6fct94zkaVCX\nEOF","description":"Commit Task 1"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":168,"cache_read_input_tokens":158180,"output_tokens":552,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":168},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":552,"cache_read_input_tokens":158180,"cache_creation_input_tokens":168,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":168,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ceu3gwWbhavsS2iXoV31N","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","attributionSkill":"superpowers:using-git-worktrees","attributionPlugin":"superpowers","type":"assistant","uuid":"d16fb25d-f370-4183-80e5-6d22e0a7824d","timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:27:15.713Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA/.worktrees/phase4-alignment","sessionId":"b8143861-beec-4930-9c27-06bc9d94fa8b","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"main"}
