{"parentUuid":"f34d4123-1cdf-4c2f-bd56-765ec92fa84e","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5c3145ddf1f0dffe","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ceu3zB3uZVLjmeWF4rgBR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KerFfg1AobxkSkWRzoZMFp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add -A && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git log --oneline -1\nAdd the outcome abstraction and the three-term decomposition\n\nThe decomposition is the phase's answer, so it is built to be checkable rather\nthan believed.\n\nThree terms, never two. delta = sum (p1-p0)*r0 + sum p0*(r1-r0) +\nsum (p1-p0)*(r1-r0). The two-term Oaxaca forms fold the interaction into\nwhichever term is evaluated at year-1 weights, which quietly flatters whichever\nstory the analyst already holds. The identity is asserted on synthetic data and\non all 52 real dimension-by-subset combinations.\n\nThe outcome is a parameter, not a hardcoded column. Success rate and explosive\nrate both run through the same path, and a test decomposes a plain numeric\ncolumn to prove Phase 2's epa will drop in without a rewrite rather than\nleaving that claim untested until the merge.\n\nTwo tests tie the arithmetic back to numbers that are already published: the\ndecomposition must reproduce 57.4 -> 49.5 overall and 61.7 -> 42.7 on\nearly-down runs. A fourth pins the per-group rates against analysis.rate_by,\nbecause a divergence there would put two different numbers for the same cut\ninto one report and nothing would error.\n\nThe OTHER rule earns its place twice: it keeps every named group above the\n30-play floor, and it keeps every group present in both seasons, which the\narithmetic needs — a group that exists in only one year has no counterpart\nrate to difference against.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cpiq4uQvzv6fct94zkaVCX\nEOF","description":"Commit Tasks 5-6"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3735,"cache_read_input_tokens":181247,"output_tokens":905,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":210},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3735},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":905,"cache_read_input_tokens":181247,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3735,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3735,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Ceu3z9h3uJ9FUCRXcH9DH","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","attributionSkill":"superpowers:using-git-worktrees","attributionPlugin":"superpowers","type":"assistant","uuid":"157f296c-943d-448b-940b-6b56da4ede16","timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:31:13.977Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA/.worktrees/phase4-alignment","sessionId":"b8143861-beec-4930-9c27-06bc9d94fa8b","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"main"}
