{"parentUuid":"23fe907d-b3c9-4797-9622-7fbe6e0ddf81","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5c3145ddf1f0dffe","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ceu4RDzDGEWoPVkCPyPP9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0151HQk4C27DQANG95NASrK9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":".venv/bin/python build_alignment_tables.py && .venv/bin/python build_alignment_report.py && sed -n '1,80p' outputs/ALIGNMENT.md","description":"Build tables and report, inspect output"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":160,"cache_read_input_tokens":219529,"output_tokens":138,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":160},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":138,"cache_read_input_tokens":219529,"cache_creation_input_tokens":160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":160,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ceu4RD4QXBSC6pm8veE4y","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","attributionSkill":"superpowers:using-git-worktrees","attributionPlugin":"superpowers","type":"assistant","uuid":"d4a587c4-1d74-4b3e-85c7-bc9e1ccbddc9","timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:36:42.353Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA/.worktrees/phase4-alignment","sessionId":"b8143861-beec-4930-9c27-06bc9d94fa8b","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"d4a587c4-1d74-4b3e-85c7-bc9e1ccbddc9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"3972e979-5e75-4953-aa06-0c7c970352c1","agentId":"a5c3145ddf1f0dffe","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0151HQk4C27DQANG95NASrK9","type":"tool_result","content":"wrote 99 alignment tables\nwrote outputs/alignment_provenance.json\nwrote outputs/ALIGNMENT.md\n# Baylor Offensive Alignment vs Play-Call Outcome\n\n## Phase 4 — 1,935 charted plays, 2024 and 2025\n\n**Audience:** analytics staff. **Question:** does alignment explain the 2024-to-2025 decline Phase 1 located but could not account for?\n\n---\n\n## How much of this you can believe\n\nRead this before the findings, not after them. There are 347 graded early-down runs in 2024 and 295 in 2025. That is a season's worth of football and it is still a small sample once it is cut by formation.\n\n- **The decomposition totals are stable.** They are weighted sums over the whole sample, so per-cell noise largely cancels.\n- **Individual cell movements mostly are not findings.** A cell of forty graded plays carries an interval of roughly fifteen points on its success rate. Cells are therefore sorted by sample size and **not ranked by change** anywhere in this report — ranking noisy cells by how far they moved is how a null result gets dressed up as an insight.\n- **A cut with a small denominator is not a finding.** Any cell with fewer than 30 graded plays in either season is marked `low_n`, and no claim here rests on one.\n- Descriptive cut tables suppress groups thinner than 15 graded plays, following Phase 1. The decomposition suppresses nothing, because dropping a group would break the arithmetic; thin groups are folded into `OTHER` instead and every summary row reports how much of the season landed there.\n- **This report contains no EPA.** Expected points needs a model this project does not have. Nothing here is a proxy for it.\n\n---\n\n## The verdict\n\nOverall success rate fell from **57.4%** to **49.5%**, a drop of **7.9 points**. Splitting that change into the part caused by Baylor and its opponents lining up differently (**mix**) and the part caused by the same alignments producing less (**efficacy**):\n\n| Term | Points |\n|---|---|\n| Mix — the weights moved | -0.5 |\n| Efficacy — the rates moved | -8.8 |\n| Interaction | 1.3 |\n| **Total change** | **-7.9** |\n\n**Alignment mix does not explain the decline.** Across every dimension tested, the largest mix term anywhere is 1.1 points — on `mofo_shown` — against a typical efficacy term of 8.0 points. Baylor did not line up meaningfully differently in 2025, defences did not line up meaningfully differently against them, and if you had held the 2025 usage of every alignment at its 2024 level the season would have looked almost exactly the same.\n\nThat is a null result on the mix hypothesis, and it is reported as one. The decline is an efficacy drop: the same looks, in the same proportions, produced less.\n\nA mix term is called negligible here when it is more than 3x smaller than the typical efficacy term. The threshold is stated so it can be disagreed with.\n\n### The sharpest cut Phase 1 found\n\nEarly-down running fell from 61.7% to 42.7%. Decomposed by run concept — the best-powered cut in this phase, with all 5 groups clearing the low-n floor in both seasons — the split is -0.8 points of mix against -18.0 points of efficacy. Baylor called much the same concepts in much the same proportions. Every one of them produced less.\n\n---\n\n## Decomposition, every dimension and subset\n\n`mix`, `efficacy` and `interaction` are in percentage points and sum exactly to `delta`. `other_share` is the fraction of 2025 plays folded into `OTHER` because the label was too thin in one season or the other; a row where that is large is not a result.\n\n| dimension        | subset          | outcome      |   n_2024 |   n_2025 |   rate_2024 |   rate_2025 |   delta |   mix |   efficacy |   interaction |   other_share |   groups |\n|:-----------------|:----------------|:-------------|---------:|---------:|------------:|------------:|--------:|------:|-----------:|--------------:|--------------:|---------:|\n| personnel_base   | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 |  0.35 |      -7.75 |         -0.55 |          0.61 |        3 |\n| form_fam_norm    | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -0.47 |      -8.76 |          1.28 |         15.62 |        6 |\n| motion_used      | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -0.01 |      -7.94 |          0.01 |          0    |        2 |\n| gen_mo_family    | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -0.18 |      -7.93 |          0.17 |         19.27 |        4 |\n| form_adjust_used | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -0.14 |      -8.21 |          0.41 |          0    |        2 |\n| tempo_used       | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -0.09 |      -8    |          0.14 |          0    |        2 |\n| hash             | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -0.51 |      -8.3  |          0.86 |          2.23 |        4 |\n| shift_used       | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -0.04 |      -7.97 |          0.07 |          0    |        2 |\n| play_action_used | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 |  0.01 |      -7.94 |         -0.01 |          0    |        2 |\n| def_package_norm | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 |  0.62 |      -6.59 |         -1.98 |         10.34 |        4 |\n| box_count_band   | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 |  0.22 |      -7.72 |         -0.44 |          0    |        4 |\n| mofo_shown       | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -1.06 |      -8    |          1.12 |          3.04 |        3 |\n| mofo_rotated     | all_plays       | success_rate |      928 |      986 |       57.44 |       49.49 |   -7.94 | -0.84 |      -7.98 |          0.87 |          3.04 |        3 |\n| personnel_base   | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 |  0.15 |     -11.09 |         -0.14 |          4.34 |        2 |\n| form_fam_norm    | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 | -0.31 |     -11.91 |          1.13 |         18.83 |        5 |\n| motion_used      | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 | -0.02 |     -11.16 |          0.09 |          0    |        2 |\n| gen_mo_family    | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 | -0.09 |     -11.17 |          0.17 |         21.27 |        3 |\n| form_adjust_used | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 | -0.17 |     -11.2  |          0.29 |          0    |        2 |\n| tempo_used       | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 | -0.08 |     -11.13 |          0.13 |          0    |        2 |\n| hash             | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 | -0.47 |     -11.15 |          0.53 |          1.36 |        4 |\n| shift_used       | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 |  0    |     -11.1  |          0.01 |          4.2  |        2 |\n| play_action_used | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 |  0.01 |     -11    |         -0.1  |          0    |        2 |\n| def_package_norm | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 |  0.37 |     -10.7  |         -0.76 |          8.67 |        4 |\n| box_count_band   | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 |  0.27 |     -10.59 |         -0.77 |          0    |        4 |\n| mofo_shown       | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 | -1.15 |     -10.85 |          0.91 |          2.03 |        3 |\n| mofo_rotated     | early_downs     | success_rate |      697 |      738 |       58.11 |       47.02 |  -11.09 | -0.91 |     -10.9  |          0.72 |          2.03 |        3 |\n| personnel_base   | early_down_runs | success_rate |      347 |      295 |       61.67 |       42.71 |  -18.96 | -0.11 |     -19.39 |          0.53 |          6.1  |        2 |\n| form_fam_norm    | early_down_runs | success_rate |      347 |      295 |       61.67 |       42.71 |  -18.96 | -0.11 |     -19.43 |          0.58 |         34.58 |        4 |\n| motion_used      | early_down_runs | success_rate |      347 |      295 |       61.67 |       42.71 |  -18.96 |  0    |     -18.96 |         -0    |          0    |        2 |\n| gen_mo_family    | early_down_runs | success_rate |      347 |      295 |       61.67 |       42.71 |  -18.96 |  0.12 |     -18.98 |         -0.1  |         14.58 |        3 |\n| form_adjust_used | early_down_runs | success_rate |      347 |      295 |       61.67 |       42.71 |  -18.96 |  0.59 |     -18.33 |         -1.22 |          0    |        2 |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"a349a5fc-7bc5-44a0-96ce-e6acb44a5596","timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:36:43.705Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"wrote 99 alignment tables\nwrote outputs/alignment_provenance.json\nwrote outputs/ALIGNMENT.md\n# Baylor Offensive Alignment vs P